      "message": "This is no longer random.\nI do not know the importance of the rand but to keep it we can do something like this:\n```c++\nstatic const int32_t collision_timeout_prop \u003d osi_property_get_int32(        RFCOMM_COLLISION_TIMEOUT_PROPERTY, -1);\n\nif (collision_timeout_prop !\u003d -1) {\n  collision_timeout \u003d (uint16_t)collision_timeout_prop\n} else {\n  collision_timeout \u003d (uint16_t)(bluetooth::common::time_get_os_boottime_ms() % 10 + 2;\n}\n```",
